{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And Rosh</b> — two times in the Masorah: here, and the other: 'He remembers the affliction and wanderings of the poor' (Lamentations 1:7), 'and sees' (וראש). As stated in the Midrash: Benjamin named all his sons after the troubles that befell Joseph. This is 'and Rosh' — after 'He remembers the affliction and wanderings of the poor, and sees.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:27.760634720Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}